                "text": "I was honored to visit the Bowen Senior Center in Pontiac. Folks were most concerned about Rx drugs and health care, and we all agreed that health care is a human right. I'm not afraid to stand up to Big Pharma and the insurance lobby to fight for our seniors and our famlies. https://t.co/Xq3tYPE8Ji",
